# Compose / Kotlin UI

- Kotlin 2.x + `org.jetbrains.kotlin.plugin.compose`; no `kotlinCompilerExtensionVersion`
- Material 3 only (`androidx.compose.material3.*`), not Material 2
- Hoist state; Screen (stateless) + Route/ViewModel pattern
- Collect with `collectAsStateWithLifecycle()`, not bare `collectAsState()`
- Lazy lists MUST use stable `key` (and `contentType` when useful)
- No `GlobalScope`, no `runBlocking` on main, no public `MutableState` / `MutableStateFlow` from VM API
- Prefer type-safe Navigation Compose
- Reader screens: immersive by default; chrome only on explicit toggle
